     <P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">关于<SPAN lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN>年市直学校高级职称申报对象<SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">专业知识测试的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">市直各学校：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">根据《<SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">2016</SPAN><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">年全市学校高级职称申报对象专业知识测试的通知》精神，</SPAN>现就市直学校高级职称申报对象专业知识测试的有关事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">一、测试时间：<SPAN lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>日上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>∶<SPAN lang=EN-US>00</SPAN>—<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>∶<SPAN lang=EN-US>00<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">二、测试地点：绍兴市稽山中学<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 1cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.89"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">请各校及时通知相关人员，并做好考风考纪教育，在测试当天随带身份证，提前半小时（<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>∶<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>）到考试地点，准时参加测试。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt">附件：一、<A title=市直笔试公告：2016年市直中学高级专业知识测试的通知. href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201611/2016111716141606.doc">市直笔试公告：2016年市直中学高级专业知识测试的通知.</A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">     </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">               </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt">绍兴市教育局教师职务评审委员会办公室<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                  </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>2016</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>16</SPAN>日<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                </P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">考核对象须知<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 29.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 1.96" align=left><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">一、专业知识测试于<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN>日上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>∶<SPAN lang=EN-US>00</SPAN>－<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>∶<SPAN lang=EN-US>00</SPAN>进行，请考核对象提前半小时到考点，提前<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>分钟进场。开考<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>分钟后禁止入场。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">二、严格遵守考试要求，考核对象凭身份证参加测试，不得携带通讯工具及任何资料、纸张和不透明文具盒、包等进入试场。所带物品按指定位置存放。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">三、测试时，应独立思考，独立完成考试内容；考试期间，保持安静，禁止喧哗。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">四、测试时只准用黑色、蓝黑色水笔或圆珠笔书写，不得在答题纸上作任何记号。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">五、测试过程中，不得向监考人员提出与测试内容有关的问题，听从监考人员指令。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">六、测试在装有视频监控的教室内进行，一旦发现违规舞弊现象，根据《</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">浙江省专业技术资格评审工作实施细则》规定，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">即取消违规舞弊者本次评审资格，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: &#718;&#805;; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">其申报材料予以退回，且从评审次年起<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>年内不受理申报高一级专业技术资格，并予以通报，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">直至给予必要的纪律处分。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><BR style="PAGE-BREAK-BEFORE: always" clear=all></SPAN></P>
